    "synopsis": {
        "native": "S\u00e9bastien n\u2019a qu\u2019une ambition dans la vie : ne rien faire. Son horizon, c\u2019est son canap\u00e9. Sa vie il ne veut pas la vivre mais la contempler. Mais aujourd\u2019hui, si tu ne fais rien... Tu n\u2019es rien. Alors pouss\u00e9 par ses deux colocs, qui enchainent stages et petits boulots, la d\u00e9cid\u00e9e Anna et le pas tout \u00e0 fait d\u00e9cid\u00e9 Bruno, S\u00e9bastien va devoir faire ... Un peu.",
        "english": "S\u00e9bastien has only one ambition in life: to do nothing. His couch is his horizon. He doesn't want to live his life, he just wants to contemplate it. But, these days, if you don't do anything, you amount to nothing. Encouraged by his two roommates, determined Anna and vacillating Bruno, who go from internship to odd job, S\u00e9bastien must do... A little of something."
    },
